    <bpmn:process id="W_W1807" name="W1807. Rebate Forecasting &amp; Annual Income Projection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget process (W1646); quarterly forecast update
Frequency: Annual + quarterly updates
Volume: 1 annual projection + 3 quarterly updates
Owner: FP&amp;A
Participants: FP&amp;A, VP Merchandising, Category Managers, CFO
Source: workflow W1807 — Rebate Forecasting &amp; Annual Income Projection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1807_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1807_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1807_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1807_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1807_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1807_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1807_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1807_Start3" name="Annual budget process (W1646); quarterly forecast update">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1807_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1807_Task4" name="Annual rebate income projection: (a) per agreement: project annual purchase…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Annual rebate income projection: (a) per agreement: project annual purchase volume × applicable rebate rate = projected rebate income, (b) aggregate by vendor, category, and total, (c) include co-op marketing income projection, (d) include markdown allowance recovery projection, (e) apply historical realization rate (% of accrued rebates actually received): typically 85–95%, (f) net projected rebate income = gross projection × realization rate
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1807_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1807_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1807_Task5" name="Impact on gross margin budget: (a) category gross margin target includes rebate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Impact on gross margin budget: (a) category gross margin target includes rebate income, (b) FP&amp;A ensures rebate projection is realistic and not double-counted (rebate reduces COGS, which improves gross margin — but must not be counted as revenue), (c) sensitivity analysis: what if top 5 vendors reduce rebate rates by 1%?
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1807_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1807_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1807_Task6" name="Quarterly forecast update: (a) update projection based on actual YTD purchases…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quarterly forecast update: (a) update projection based on actual YTD purchases and settlements, (b) adjust for new agreements, terminated agreements, rate changes, (c) compare forecast to accrual — adjust accrual rates if forecast changes significantly
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1807_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1807_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1807_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1807_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1807_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-360 (ensure controlled execution — Rebate Settlement &amp; Analytics (PA-39.3).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1807_Assoc9" sourceRef="W1807_Annotation8" targetRef="W1807_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
